                                        "entry_id": "ae8c1220-d461-32d4-b7ac-cd93c0565487",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To prepare (someone) for an event"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ba2e201-348e-4651-87cc-94d52474706a",
                                                "sense_id": "231aed3e-325b-3d76-8b01-203bc8c7c4fc",
                                                "text": "It appears that Broderick's seconds, although cool, brave men, were entirely without experience in arranging a duel, and did not know that a man should be groomed for one as carefully as a horse is groomed for a race."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76bb505f-410e-3f98-bd1c-8b9a71ea69c1",
                                        "entry_id": "ae8c1220-d461-32d4-b7ac-cd93c0565487",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To prepare (someone) for election or appointment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3918cdf7-0495-43de-826d-e615da0af47e",
                                                "sense_id": "76bb505f-410e-3f98-bd1c-8b9a71ea69c1",
                                                "text": "It is of special interest to note the subjects considered as important to those who are being groomed for top administrative posts"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59ef1d5b-047f-4ca9-8dc1-7d7f6ea145c3",
                                                "sense_id": "76bb505f-410e-3f98-bd1c-8b9a71ea69c1",
                                                "text": "2002, Clone High episode 1 - \"Escape to Beer Mountain: A Rope of Sand\"\nOur mission is to unfreeze those clones, send them back to high school, and secretly groom them to one day rule the world. Failure to do so could mean world leaders just keep getting worse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33c8d9f8-5bbf-427e-b03f-6ff6d6e879e3",
                                                "sense_id": "76bb505f-410e-3f98-bd1c-8b9a71ea69c1",
                                                "text": "2009, Dani Johnson, Grooming the Next Generation for Success"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fd18fb2-4ab8-4936-b7f3-5ab319092c38",
                                                "sense_id": "76bb505f-410e-3f98-bd1c-8b9a71ea69c1",
                                                "text": "2012 (February 28) in \"The Man Behind the Curtain\" s3e7 of TV series Justified\nI was the son he always wanted. He groomed me to take over someday, but now Sammy's got the houses, the cars, the money, the juice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edc09495-b75b-4c12-a155-c2a4c07b82b4",
                                                "sense_id": "76bb505f-410e-3f98-bd1c-8b9a71ea69c1",
                                                "text": "India is run by gerontocrats and epigones: grey hairs and groomed heirs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a0834ae-6aae-4d29-95b7-4fe6e6887d77",
                                                "sense_id": "76bb505f-410e-3f98-bd1c-8b9a71ea69c1",
                                                "text": "2023 in \"The Walking Dead: Daryl Dixon\" episode 5 \"Deux Amours\" regarding Laurent\nDaryl \"But he's gonna be safe? I'm afraid those nuns raised him a little -- a little soft.\"\nLosang \"He'll be well looked after. Nurtured and groomed... to be the leader he's destined to be.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "574a5a5d-9024-3279-a586-fabbfa5e0a62",
                                        "entry_id": "ae8c1220-d461-32d4-b7ac-cd93c0565487",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To gain, or attempt to gain, the trust of a child or vulnerable person in order to take advantage of or exploit them, especially sexually (if under the age of consent)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b788949-7619-4e54-94ed-c2abf6297677",
                                                "sense_id": "574a5a5d-9024-3279-a586-fabbfa5e0a62",
                                                "text": "2009, Suzanne Ost, Child Pornography and Sexual Grooming: Legal and Societal Responses"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ca6fc17-b044-3829-946b-582701f4a309",
                                        "entry_id": "ae8c1220-d461-32d4-b7ac-cd93c0565487",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In agile software development, to review and prioritize the items in the development backlog."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83004db4-e1c3-3e80-8753-eb45d94b875f",
                                        "entry_id": "ae8c1220-d461-32d4-b7ac-cd93c0565487",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To prepare (a ski slope) for skiers by packing down the snow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
